OL,3,GNEWSATrial set for men accused of
OL,4,Asynagogue bomb plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian men have appeared in court
OL,7,Fover an alleged plot to target the
OL,8,FJewish community in Manchester with a
OL,9,Fhomemade bomb.
OL,11,FSalam Ahmadyan, 36, of Liverpool, and
OL,12,FRahman Salehi, 34, of Salford, are
OL,13,Faccused of conducting hostile
OL,14,Freconnaissance at Heaton Park
OL,15,FSynagogue, which was subject to a fatal
OL,16,Fattack last year, along with the Jewish
OL,17,FMuseum in Cheetham Hill.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
