OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATrial set for men accused of
OL,4,Asynagogue bomb plot
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pair, who arrived illegally into
OL,7,Fthe UK on boats, are charged with
OL,8,Fengaging in conduct in preparation for
OL,9,Fterrorist acts on or before 20
OL,10,FSeptember. They deny the charges.
OL,12,FThey appeared via videolink at the Old
OL,13,FBailey and a trial date was set at
OL,14,FManchester Crown Court for 15 June
OL,15,F2027.
